  "description": "Through relentlessly stealing relics, Jooheon naturally became the King of Relics, the Supreme Majesty. Now, his retirement plan of securing a dazzling future for his unborn daughter is interrupted by a cosmic force. When it causes his future child to disappear, Jooheon vows to tear the cosmos apart. Forced into the chaotic War of Majesty, apocalyptic anomalies fracture reality as a variant Majesty with a shockingly familiar face steps onto the battlefield. Refusing to let history be rewritten, Jooheon hops through dimensions to prove that not even a god can steal from him.\n\n_Source: Tappytoon_",
